### Public health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health/ready

### Login: use the admin created with python -m app.cli create-admin
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"replace-with-your-admin-password"}

### Set token in your HTTP client's private environment
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Courses
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/courses?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
